set)\n  - Training runners (SimpleTimeSeriesForecastingRunner)\n  - Metrics (masked_mae, masked_mape, masked_rmse)\n  - Utilities (ZScoreScaler, load_adj, get_regular_settings)\n\n### Event Processing\n- **google.genai**: Generative AI client\n- **vertexai**: Vertex AI Text Embedding API\n- **pandas**: Data manipulation\n- **numpy**: Numerical operations\n- **tqdm**: Progress tracking\n\n### External Services\n- Google Cloud Project (for Gemini and Vertex AI APIs)\n- Service account authentication\n- API quotas and rate limiting\n\n## Data Formats\n\n### Input\n- **Traffic Data**: HDF5 format (.h5)\n  - Time-indexed tables\n  - 5-minute temporal resolution\n  - 207-358 sensor nodes\n  \n- **Sensor Locations**: CSV format\n  - Columns: index, sensor_id, latitude, longitude\n  \n- **Spatial Graphs**: Pickle format (.pkl)\n  - Adjacency matrices\n  - Double-transition format\n\n### Output\n- **Event Embeddings**: NPZ compressed format\n  - Shape: (num_timestamps, 768)\n  - Dtype: float32\n  \n- **Model Predictions**: PyTorch tensors\n  - Shape: (batch, output_len, num_nodes, 1)\n  - Dtype: float32\n\n## Training Configuration\n\n### Common Parameters (All Datasets)\n- **Optimizer**: Adam (lr=0.002, weight_decay=1e-5)\n- **Loss**: Masked MAE\n- **Scheduler**: MultiStepLR with step-wise decay\n- **Epochs**: 100\n- **Gradient Clipping**: max_norm=5.0\n- **Metrics**: MAE, MAPE, RMSE\n- **Evaluation Horizons**: [3, 6, 12] steps (15, 30, 60 minutes)\n\n### Model Hyperparameters\n- **num_feat**: 1 (single metric)\n- **num_hidden**: 32\n- **dropout**: 0.1\n- **seq_length**: 12 (60 minutes input)\n- **num_modalities**: 2 (CRITICAL - dual-modal)\n- **num_layers**: 5\n- **time_in_day_size**: 288 (5-min slots per day)\n- **day_in_week_size**: 7\n\n## Key Features for LibCity Integration\n\n### 1. Multi-Modal Data Handling\n- Separate processing streams for traffic and events\n- Learned fusion mechanisms\n- Flexible modality combination strategies\n\n### 2. Text Embedding Integrati