oring\n2. Visualization tools\n3. Hyperparameter tuning utilities\n4. Benchmark comparison scripts\n\n## Performance Expectations\n\n### Typical Results (Estimated)\n- **MAE**: 2-4 (depending on dataset and metrics scale)\n- **MAPE**: 3-8%\n- **RMSE**: 3-6\n- **Training Time**: 1-2 hours per dataset (single GPU)\n- **Memory Usage**: 4-8 GB GPU memory\n\n### Factors Affecting Performance\n- Event data quality and relevance\n- Temporal alignment accuracy\n- Spatial resolution (sensor density)\n- Training data size and splits\n- Hardware specifications\n\n## External API Dependencies\n\n### Google Cloud Services (Current Implementation)\n\n**Gemini 2.5 Pro API**:\n- Event identification from location/time\n- Structured JSON output\n- ~1-2 seconds per timestamp\n\n**Vertex AI Text Embedding API**:\n- Model: text-embedding-005\n- Dimension: 768\n- Cost: Per-token billing\n\n### Replacement Options (For LibCity)\n\n1. **Open-Source LLMs** (Ollama, LLaMA):\n   - Local execution, no API costs\n   - May need fine-tuning for event detection\n\n2. **Open-Source Embeddings** (Sentence Transformers, BERT):\n   - Pre-trained models available\n   - Flexible dimensionality\n\n3. **Hybrid Approach**:\n   - LLM for event detection\n   - Sentence transformers for embeddings\n\n## Evaluation Metrics\n\n### Supported Metrics\n- **MAE**: Mean Absolute Error\n- **MAPE**: Mean Absolute Percentage Error\n- **RMSE**: Root Mean Squared Error\n\n### Evaluation Configuration\n```python\nCFG.EVAL.HORIZONS = [3, 6, 12]    # 15, 30, 60 min ahead\nCFG.EVAL.USE_GPU = True            # GPU-accelerated evaluation\n```\n\n### Null Value Handling\n- Masked metrics handle missing data\n- Dataset-specific null values defined\n- Careful handling in normalization\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Step 1: Review Analysis Documents\n- Read FUSE-TRAFFIC_SUMMARY.txt for overview\n- Check FUSE-TRAFFIC_ANALYSIS.md for details\n- Study FUSE-TRAFFIC_CODE_SNIPPETS.md for implementation\n\n### Step 2: Examine Repository\n